  "body": "Safari, Chrome and FF (haven't tested IE/Edge) all explicitly support `soft`, `hard` and the unspecified `off` values for textarea's `wrap` attribute, where `off` disables wrapping entirely. Currently the spec only has `soft` (default) and `hard`.\n",
